<h1>Dan Olas</h1>
<p>27th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.danolas.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (danolas.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Challenging Ald. Walter Burnett III, son of the former alderman, and says the Burnett family has mismanaged the ward. His top-10 issues list includes public safety with more police cameras and stricter sentencing, lower property and sales taxes and CTA fares, new grocery stores, new CTA and Metra stations in the ward, and 8-year term limits for city elected officials.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Owner of Grand Ideas Staffing and a 30-year 27th Ward resident; stage-4 cancer survivor who volunteers on the University of Illinois Chicago Hospital Cancer Center community board and with Catholic Charities.</p>
